=== back-to-indent-leading-space
tags: vi-back-to-indent
keys: \s\s\sindented text\e<pause>\C-xi<dump>\r

=== back-to-indent-tabs
tags: vi-back-to-indent
keys: \C-v\t\C-v\tx y\e<pause>\C-xi<dump>\r

=== back-to-indent-all-blank
tags: vi-back-to-indent
keys: \s\s\s\e<pause>\C-xi<dump>\r

=== back-to-indent-no-indent
tags: vi-back-to-indent
keys: word\e<pause>\C-xi<dump>\r

